      {
        "formula": "SO'ROQ: Have/Has + EGA + got ...? → Yes, EGA have/has.",
        "exampleEn": "Has he got blue eyes? — Yes, he has. / No, he hasn't.",
        "exampleUz": "Uning ko'zi ko'kmi? — Ha. / Yo'q.",
        "explanationUz": "Qisqa javobda 'got' YO'Q. 'do/does' ham ishlatilmaydi."
